# Haruki Tanaka, CEO of Bushido-ArmaTech. Two topics about Logan Faust (former board).
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (He does not ask how you got in.) Bushido-ArmaTech. Peace through strength. You have the look of someone who buys the second part.
#
o_text: Logan Faust sat on your board.
o_id: haruki_faust
o_goto: Faust
#
o_text: Why did Faust leave?
o_id: haruki_faust_left
o_goto: FaustLeft
#
o_text: Looking for work.
o_id: haruki_work
o_goto: Work
#
o_text: Just looking.
o_id: haruki_leave
o_goto: End

name: Faust
npc: Sat. Past tense, and the nameplate came off the lobby wall the same week. He was my father's man, not mine.
+ Brilliant with numbers. Weak stomach.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: faust_back
o_goto: Default

name: FaustLeft
npc: He read a partner's proposal he was not meant to read and resigned the same night. Eschaton calls it a cleansing; Logan called it murder, in the minutes.
+ If you find him, tell him the board voted without him. It always did.
effect: SetFlag('KnowsAbout(golden_ticket)')
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: faustleft_back
o_goto: Default

name: Work
npc: Miller handles hiring. I handle who she is allowed to hire.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: work_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: Strength, then.
effect: EndConversation
